        },
        {
          "text": "Na Aavu amũkũlya Eliya, Nũmbonete, we mũmaitha wakwa? Na asũngĩa, Nĩnĩkwonete, nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩwĩthooetye wĩke ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũthũku. ",
