              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩwene ũndũ Aavu ũkwĩnyivya mbee wakwa? Nũndũ nũkwĩnyivya mbee wakwa, ndikaete ũthũku ũsu mĩthenyanĩ yake; ĩndĩ mĩthenyanĩ ya mwana wake ngaete ũthũku ũsu nyũmbanĩ yake. ",
